3. Project 1 Roadmap — Production MCP Tool Server & Protocol Gateway
Architecture & Interface Specs
This project establishes a standardized protocol translation layer adhering to Model Context Protocol (MCP) standards. It serves as the primary data-bus between heterogeneous AI clients and local tool runtimes.


* Transport Layer: Dual-mode transport architecture supporting stdio (for local process IPC) and HTTP with Server-Sent Events (SSE) for remote streaming interfaces.
* Validation Layer: Schema definition and runtime enforcement utilizing Pydantic (Python) and Zod (TypeScript) to guarantee payload sanity.
* Negotiation Mechanism: Dynamic bidirectional capability handshakes during initialization to advertise tools, prompts, and resource access limits.
