5. Project 3 Roadmap — Turnkey Edge-Inference Local Appliance & Distribution CLI
Architecture & Packaging
Transforming discrete local services into a unified, zero-dependency local appliance designed for air-gapped or localized operation.


* CLI Interface: Go/Rust lightweight binary CLI handling setup, model pulling, vector index initialization, and daemon management.
* Inference Engine: Embedded bindings to Ollama and llama.cpp for GGUF-quantized local model execution.
* Local Storage: SQLite augmented with sqlite-vec extension for local vector indexing and sub-millisecond retrieval without remote dependencies.
* Deployment: Single binary execution mode alongside optimized docker-compose footprint operating under strict zero cloud egress configuration.
